# Space energy + journals

## Tent parity

In one pass, treat `4x8` and `2x4` at the **same development point** (API, mutate, force-tick, UI, walk rows). Do not ship or close with one tent read-only.

## Hard gates

- Schedule shift / lights-on mutate requires `confirm=true` — never silent.
- Learning and suggestions always `apply: false` (planning signal only).
- Flip approve/deny does **not** write lights-on helpers.
- Conflict may `suggest_move`; never auto-move plants.
- No lighting controls on plant cards — plant UI = mini journal only.

## Journals

Hierarchy on same `dsc_ops.sqlite3`: plant → tent space → room (`grow_room`) → DSC-Core. Read-time rollups; provenance chips (`plant|space|room|core`). Observations ≠ diagnoses. Facility system rows bubble via `facility_journal.bubble_facility_system`.

## Honesty

pot3/4 = `planned_oos` only — never Capacity offline lead. Skill: `dsc-space-photoperiod-journal`.

## Pi prove / closure

Record pre lights-on for both tents before force-tick; Cancel + restore after; leave no active plans. Mark parent space-energy **implemented** only after walk matrix rows are filled (`docs/qa/SPACE-ENERGY-PI-WALK-*.md`). Hotpatch: `.audit/space-energy-pi-closure.ps1` + `dsc-pi-hotpatch.mdc`.
